 our communities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/25/sun-communities-inc-sui-q1-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"SUI 2019 Q1","e":"sui","d":"2019-04-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gary A. Shiffman","x":"And we are all pretty aware of how many financial institutions, severance and other platforms have been created over the last three, four years, probably attracted the fundamentals that Sun and its competitors are well aware about that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/25/sun-communities-inc-sui-q1-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"SUI 2019 Q3","e":"sui","d":"2019-10-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"John Pawlowski","x":"John, moving to next year, do you expect a stronger, a similar or weaker pricing power environment across the portfolio on the MH and RV side?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/sun-communities-inc-sui-q3-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"SUI 2021 Q1","e":"sui","d":"2021-04-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Karen J. Dearing","x":"We are also netting all utility income against utility expense, which provides a better view on what Sun's direct utility costs are since the majority of these costs are passed through to our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/27/sun-communities-inc-sui-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"SUI 2021 Q1","e":"sui","d":"2021-04-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Gary A. Shiffman","x":"So, we're seeing small incremental price increases on the homes being delivered for our manufactured housing communities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/27/sun-communities-inc-sui-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"SUI 2021 Q1","e":"sui","d":"2021-04-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gary A. Shiffman","x":"And then as you follow that even further into marinas, as many of you are aware, there was recapitalization and restructuring at Sunteck[Phonetic], the second largest marina holder and another portfolio -- small portfolio acquired by ELS.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/27/sun-communities-inc-sui-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"SUI 2024 Q3","e":"sui","d":"2024-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fernando Castro-Caratini","x":"The other components of the non-recurring, we had an additional $2.5 million of deal costs and severance expenses in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/sun-communities-sui-q3-2024-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SUI 2024 Q3","e":"sui","d":"2024-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Gary Shiffman","x":"Starting with our board of directors, the entire Sun organization is committed to proactively addressing our challenges and restructuring Sun to unlock the value and earnings potential of our portfolio as we demonstrated for the past two decades.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/sun-communities-sui-q3-2024-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SUI 2024 Q4","e":"sui","d":"2025-02-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John McLaren","x":"Specific to our performance relative to the $15 million to $20 million restructuring plan we have implemented, we have already captured approximately $11 million of G&A savings within the plan. realized approximately $4 million in operating expense savings in the fourth quarter and expect to…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/sun-communities-sui-q4-2024-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SUI 2024 Q4","e":"sui","d":"2025-02-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John McLaren","x":"In addition to that, when you think in terms of expansion beyond what we originally said in the restructuring plan, we're already realizing expansion of the higher adoption of our centralized procurement platform which is generating additional savings through more standardization and economies of…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/sun-communities-sui-q4-2024-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SUI 2025 Q2","e":"sui","d":"2025-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gary A. Shiffman","x":"We have taken deliberate steps to streamline operations, unlock meaningful financial flexibility and enhance shareholder value.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/sun-communities-sui-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SUI 2025 Q2","e":"sui","d":"2025-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gary A. Shiffman","x":"Total North American same-property NOI grew 4.9% in the second quarter, driven primarily by the continued growth and stability of our manufactured housing portfolio as well as the benefit of our ongoing cost savings initiatives and greater efficiency at the expense level.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/sun-communities-sui-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SUI 2025 Q3","e":"sui","d":"2025-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John McLaren","x":"They've done a great job of strategically shifting the earnings mix towards stable recurring real property income while maintaining strong market share and pricing power despite what you're talking about is the challenging macro backdrop.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/sun-communities-sui-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SUI 2025 Q3","e":"sui","d":"2025-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"David Segall","x":"And just with regard to expenses, can you talk about what's driving the cost savings?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/sun-communities-sui-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SUI 2026 Q3","e":"sui","d":"2026-10-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Charles D. Young","x":"That said, we are at about 98% occupancy, and so we see ourselves as being highly occupied, healthy place to be, gives pricing power and other things go with that.","url":"https://w